1
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:56,060
Close the door.

2
00:01:05,319 --> 00:01:05,920
Count it.

3
00:01:06,920 --> 00:01:07,980
No need, Master Hu.

4
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:09,840
It's been so many years.

5
00:01:09,840 --> 00:01:10,680
We trust you.

6
00:01:15,320 --> 00:01:16,780
Someone touched the safe.

7
00:01:24,240 --> 00:01:25,700
There's someone outside.

8
00:01:28,600 --> 00:01:29,320
Who is it?

9
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:30,960
You came to my place.

10
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:32,810
Do you have a death wish?

11
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:35,600
Go save Li Xuefei.

12
00:01:50,039 --> 00:01:51,770
Master Hu, here's another one.

13
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:56,680
Stop right there!

14
00:01:57,840 --> 00:01:59,100
Where are you running?

15
00:02:01,440 --> 00:02:02,120
Stop!

16
00:02:12,040 --> 00:02:12,720
Stop!

17
00:02:29,440 --> 00:02:30,440
Stop right there!

18
00:02:42,200 --> 00:02:43,440
Let's see where you can run.

19
00:02:43,440 --> 00:02:44,000
Go.

20
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:49,200
Stop!

21
00:02:52,040 --> 00:02:53,120
I'll kill you!

22
00:03:03,760 --> 00:03:04,520
Hurry!

23
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:13,160
You can't escape!

24
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:35,440
Bicycle!

25
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:36,329
Hurry up!

26
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:37,000
Quick!

27
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:37,680
Hurry!

28
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:48,280
Who touched my painting?

29
00:03:50,079 --> 00:03:50,760
What's wrong?

30
00:03:50,760 --> 00:03:51,720
Did you hide something here?

31
00:03:51,720 --> 00:03:52,780
The ledger is gone.

32
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:55,500
This is where you hide things?

33
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:58,200
Cut the crap.

34
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:03,120
Boss Hu.

35
00:04:03,760 --> 00:04:04,960
There's a photo here.

36
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:09,440
Zhao Zhiguo.

37
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:12,120
Wang Min.

38
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:20,959
Xiaohu.

39
00:04:22,520 --> 00:04:23,200
What?

40
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:25,250
Do you still want to kill me?

41
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:26,920
Are you going to eat?

42
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:28,160
If not, I'll take it away.

43
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:29,400
Why would I kill you?

44
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:31,130
I love you too much for that.

45
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:33,560
Don't talk nonsense.

46
00:04:38,440 --> 00:04:39,700
Is your injury better?

47
00:04:39,880 --> 00:04:40,680
Much better.

48
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:42,640
Dr. Yang is a good doctor.

49
00:04:43,400 --> 00:04:44,800
It doesn't hurt anymore.

50
00:04:48,320 --> 00:04:48,840
Manman.

51
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:51,040
Your shredded potatoes are really delicious.

52
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:51,720
Can you... tomorrow?

53
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:52,960
There is no tomorrow.

54
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:54,159
Xiaohu.

55
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:58,320
Call your dad.

56
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:01,120
I won't.

57
00:05:01,640 --> 00:05:03,640
I feel most at ease when I'm with you.

58
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:05,330
Stop messing around, okay?

59
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:08,200
I can't cause any more trouble for Mr. Song.

60
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:09,920
The police searched the next street yesterday.

61
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:11,650
They might come here tomorrow.

62
00:05:11,960 --> 00:05:12,840
Xiaohu.

63
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:14,520
You should go.

64
00:05:15,200 --> 00:05:16,480
Mr. Song treats me well.

65
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,740
I can't be ungrateful.

66
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:20,840
Your dad will definitely find a way.

67
00:05:20,840 --> 00:05:21,640
You should go.

68
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,120
Okay.

69
00:05:32,960 --> 00:05:35,090
I won't make things difficult for you.

70
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:36,400
I'll call.

71
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:47,520
Hello, Dad.

72
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:48,280
I...

73
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:50,080
Xiaohu.

74
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:51,800
Where are you now?

75
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:54,560
I'm at the Xiaoheyan Clinic.

76
00:05:55,320 --> 00:05:56,450
Why did you go there?

77
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:57,520
Are you safe now?

78
00:05:58,080 --> 00:05:58,880
I'm safe.

79
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:00,920
Let me think.

80
00:06:02,320 --> 00:06:03,180
How about this.

81
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:05,040
Just hide there for a couple of days.

82
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:06,440
Don't go anywhere, you hear me?

83
00:06:06,440 --> 00:06:07,280
Wait until I arrange things here,

84
00:06:07,280 --> 00:06:09,080
and I'll send a car to pick you up.

85
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:11,320
Can you come pick me up right now?

86
00:06:11,320 --> 00:06:12,920
I can't hide here anymore.

87
00:06:13,320 --> 00:06:15,720
Cao Jin and his guys will find this place soon.

88
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:17,440
Son, are you stupid?

89
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:19,200
Every move I make right now

90
00:06:19,200 --> 00:06:20,160
is being watched by the police.

91
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:22,440
Picking you up now would only get you killed.

92
00:06:22,440 --> 00:06:23,440
Just listen to me.

93
00:06:23,440 --> 00:06:24,480
Stay there quietly

94
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:25,480
and wait for me to pick you up

95
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:26,880
and get you out of Xinchun.

96
00:06:26,880 --> 00:06:27,940
No, out of Xinchun?

97
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:30,160
Why would I leave Xinchun?

98
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:31,160
I'm not going anywhere.

99
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:32,480
I'm staying right here.

100
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:33,880
One minute you want to leave, the next you don't.

101
00:06:33,880 --> 00:06:34,810
What do you want?

102
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:37,380
Do you know what kind of situation you're in?

103
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:39,200
Let me tell you, Teng Xiaohu,

104
00:06:39,280 --> 00:06:40,240
if you don't listen to me,

105
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,600
no one can save you.

106
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:42,680
Dad,

107
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:44,360
I have something to tell you.

108
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:45,400
Xiaohu,

109
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:47,000
if you don't hurry up...

110
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:49,000
Manman,

111
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:51,240
can you give me five more minutes?

112
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:52,680
I have something to tell my dad.

113
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:54,010
Mr. Song is coming back.

114
00:06:54,159 --> 00:06:54,960
I'm leaving now.

115
00:06:54,960 --> 00:06:56,800
Just leave the phone here later.

116
00:06:59,040 --> 00:06:59,680
Manman.

117
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:01,480
Will we

118
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:03,580
ever see each other again?

119
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:06,040
Xiaohu!

120
00:07:06,760 --> 00:07:07,440
Xiaohu!

121
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:09,440
Hello?

122
00:07:14,520 --> 00:07:16,160
Do you remember over a decade ago

123
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:18,360
the gas cylinder explosion in Xinchun?

124
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:20,560
That gas cylinder blew up the timber mill owner

125
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:22,160
and his whole family.

126
00:07:22,760 --> 00:07:24,120
They left a kid behind.

127
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:26,580
That kid had different colored eyes.

128
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:29,160
Hello?

129
00:07:30,320 --> 00:07:30,880
Hello?

130
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:33,940
Do you know who that kid is?

131
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:35,960
That was so many years ago.

132
00:07:35,960 --> 00:07:37,560
It has nothing to do with you.

133
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:39,880
Just wait quietly for me to pick you up.

134
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:41,400
That kid is Wang Hong.

135
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:42,640
What?

136
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:44,159
Dad.

137
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:45,760
Wang Hong is messing with me.

138
00:07:45,760 --> 00:07:46,840
I can't leave.

139
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:48,920
I have to let Wang Hong know

140
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,920
what happens when he messes with me.

141
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:52,640
He must have come to Xinchun

142
00:07:52,640 --> 00:07:54,440
for the gas cylinder explosion.

143
00:07:56,159 --> 00:07:56,760
Hello.

144
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:58,280
Xiaohu.

145
00:07:58,760 --> 00:07:59,800
Xiaohu.

146
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:14,560
Xiaoma.

147
00:08:14,880 --> 00:08:15,680
You guys go here.

148
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:16,160
Okay.

149
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:19,220
Someone come here.

150
00:08:19,320 --> 00:08:20,520
You search this side.

151
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:30,800
Anything?

152
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:31,640
Nothing.

153
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:32,840
Anything?

154
00:08:32,840 --> 00:08:33,480
Nothing.

155
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:34,900
Go outside.

156
00:08:35,159 --> 00:08:35,760
Xiaoma.

157
00:08:36,159 --> 00:08:36,679
Anything?

158
00:08:36,679 --> 00:08:37,480
Nothing.

159
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:51,920
Give me a hand.

160
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:07,520
Stop!

161
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:08,400
Don't run!

162
00:09:08,880 --> 00:09:09,400
Stop!

163
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:10,720
Stop!

164
00:09:10,920 --> 00:09:11,780
Still running?

165
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:13,520
Stop!

166
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:15,200
Xiaoma.

167
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:18,760
Don't move.

168
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:22,800
Get up.

169
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:41,520
Li Xiaozhu.

170
00:09:47,640 --> 00:09:49,170
At the old forestry center,

171
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:51,200
there's a row of old poplars.

172
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:55,500
You could climb to the top.

173
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,240
Xiaopao.

174
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:02,600
It's me.

175
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:04,920
You became a cop.

176
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:06,400
That's great.

177
00:10:12,760 --> 00:10:13,840
Zhou Guangfu.

178
00:10:14,760 --> 00:10:15,620
What happened?

179
00:10:18,040 --> 00:10:19,120
I ran out of money.

180
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:22,000
My mom has rheumatism.

181
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:25,490
The kang won't even heat up.

182
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:30,170
We're so poor we can't afford food.

183
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:33,720
I don't mind starving

184
00:10:34,400 --> 00:10:35,600
or freezing to death,

185
00:10:36,760 --> 00:10:38,090
but I can't let my mom...

186
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:42,560
I saw that guy

187
00:10:43,680 --> 00:10:45,080
carrying a sack of money.

188
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:48,800
So I followed him all the way.

189
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:51,560
How did you get up

190
00:10:51,920 --> 00:10:52,980
to the fifth floor?

191
00:10:57,720 --> 00:10:58,600
My hand

192
00:10:59,640 --> 00:11:02,200
was crushed moving logs at the forestry center.

193
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:03,660
I can't move logs anymore.

194
00:11:04,640 --> 00:11:05,900
So all I can do is climb.

195
00:11:06,600 --> 00:11:07,730
Why did you kill him?

196
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:09,120
I didn't mean to kill him.

197
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:10,160
Xinkan.

198
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:12,020
I just wanted some money to spend.

199
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:14,000
He woke up.

200
00:11:16,880 --> 00:11:18,080
He scratched my face.

201
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:19,160
I panicked.

202
00:11:20,280 --> 00:11:21,880
I just grabbed something...

203
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:23,960
Did you have anything to do with the Lincheng Hotel incident?

204
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:24,920
What hotel?

205
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:26,640
Liu Ming.

206
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:27,640
Who?

207
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:29,050
You don't know Liu Ming?

208
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:32,200
I don't even know what you're talking about.

209
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:34,330
The guy who died at the Lincheng Hotel.

210
00:11:35,360 --> 00:11:36,800
I really had nothing to do with that.

211
00:11:36,800 --> 00:11:37,800
Xinkan, Xiaopao.

212
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:39,720
I've only done this once.

213
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:41,020
Xinkan.

214
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:40,960
I swear.

215
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:42,480
Xinkan.

216
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:41,360
I swear.

217
00:11:41,880 --> 00:11:42,640
I've only done this once.

218
00:11:42,640 --> 00:11:44,040
I've only done this once.

219
00:11:42,640 --> 00:11:42,760
Chanshou.

220
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:46,320
I just wanted some money

221
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:48,360
to buy my mom an electric blanket.

222
00:11:50,560 --> 00:11:52,960
The work at the forestry center is too hard.

223
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:55,160
After a day's work,

224
00:11:55,760 --> 00:11:57,560
my back doesn't feel like my own,

225
00:11:57,720 --> 00:11:59,050
and my hands are ruined.

226
00:12:01,080 --> 00:12:02,340
If my hands are ruined,

227
00:12:02,640 --> 00:12:04,240
I can't work anymore.

228
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:07,880
Why are my hands ruined?

229
00:12:10,520 --> 00:12:11,850
Let's stop here for now.

230
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:15,120
Xiaopao.

231
00:12:20,080 --> 00:12:21,080
My mom.

232
00:12:28,640 --> 00:12:29,520
Don't worry.

233
00:12:50,040 --> 00:12:50,680
Brother.

234
00:12:51,040 --> 00:12:53,520
How did you know he was the one who killed Zhou Guangfu?

235
00:12:53,520 --> 00:12:54,440
I know him.

236
00:12:56,480 --> 00:12:57,810
As for the Liu Ming case,

237
00:12:57,840 --> 00:12:58,760
he didn't do it.

238
00:13:08,120 --> 00:13:08,880
Come in.

239
00:13:12,160 --> 00:13:12,820
Chief Zhou.

240
00:13:13,040 --> 00:13:13,720
Cao Jin.

241
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:16,960
On the Zhou Guangfu case,

242
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:18,600
you did a great job.

243
00:13:19,400 --> 00:13:20,280
But

244
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:22,250
regarding the hotel murder

245
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:25,200
and Teng Xiaohu resisting arrest with a gun,

246
00:13:25,560 --> 00:13:27,040
what progress have you made?

247
00:13:27,040 --> 00:13:28,440
At the Beishan Hunting Ground,

248
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:30,120
we found a crossbow and some arrows.

249
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:31,380
The cut is very narrow,

250
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:33,720
which highly matches the wound of the deceased, Liu Ming.

251
00:13:33,720 --> 00:13:36,120
But the comparison results from the technical department are out,

252
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:37,320
and they don't match.

253
00:13:37,640 --> 00:13:38,520
Other colleagues

254
00:13:38,520 --> 00:13:40,840
have investigated the deceased's social connections.

255
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:42,800
There are very few useful clues.

256
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:44,200
But what is certain is that

257
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:45,240
Liu Ming's death

258
00:13:45,440 --> 00:13:47,840
may be related to the illegal timber trade.

259
00:13:49,400 --> 00:13:50,460
As for Teng Xiaohu,

260
00:13:51,280 --> 00:13:52,480
we are short-handed.

261
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:55,760
We have searched the places he might appear

262
00:13:55,760 --> 00:13:56,800
several times,

263
00:13:57,960 --> 00:13:59,360
but still found nothing.

264
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:00,960
No clues at all?

265
00:14:02,280 --> 00:14:03,000
No.

266
00:14:03,520 --> 00:14:04,200
Cao Jin.

267
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:08,720
The Teng Xiaohu incident has blown up.

268
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:10,560
The higher-ups are taking it very seriously.

269
00:14:10,560 --> 00:14:12,420
Resisting arrest with a firearm.

270
00:14:13,040 --> 00:14:14,720
You should know how serious this is.

271
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:16,880
We need a result as soon as possible.

272
00:14:25,040 --> 00:14:25,840
Cao Jin.

273
00:14:28,720 --> 00:14:30,480
Captain Zhang has been transferred.

274
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:33,120
The position of Criminal Investigation Captain is vacant.

275
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:35,160
You should put some effort into it.

276
00:14:35,640 --> 00:14:36,920
Understood, Chief Zhou.

277
00:14:36,920 --> 00:14:39,000
I know having two cases piled up

278
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:40,600
puts a lot of pressure on you.

279
00:14:41,680 --> 00:14:43,840
But since we wear this uniform,

280
00:14:44,040 --> 00:14:45,720
we must be responsible to the people

281
00:14:45,720 --> 00:14:47,920
and live up to the badge on our chests.

282
00:14:50,920 --> 00:14:51,640
Yes, sir.

283
00:14:52,600 --> 00:14:53,600
Tell everyone

284
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:55,200
to work hard a little longer.

285
00:14:55,200 --> 00:14:56,460
This is a tough battle.

286
00:14:59,800 --> 00:15:00,680
All right.

287
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:03,000
If there's nothing else, you may go.

288
00:15:03,320 --> 00:15:04,040
Chief Zhou.

289
00:15:04,720 --> 00:15:05,850
I'd like to follow up

290
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:07,560
on Wang Hong's case.

291
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:09,520
Wang Hong.
